{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTDimHLFPair","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTDimHLFPair","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaRows"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookRows.dimHLF_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookRows.dimHLF_pair","kind":"theorem","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTDimHLFPair.lean#L26-L71","doc":"**Two-row hook-length dimension as a ballot number (sorry-free).**\n`dimHLF [a, b] = C(a+b, b) − C(a+b, b−1)` for `a ≥ b ≥ 1` — a binomial difference, so a manifest `ℕ`\nwith no floor-division.  Pins the exactness of `dimHLF` on two rows. ","signatureChunk":0}]}